    "已有的 iCloud 备份会保留。示例书籍不会删除；没有备份的本机文件需重新导入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Existing iCloud backups are kept. Sample books aren’t deleted; local files without a backup must be imported again."
          }
