    "我所记得的故乡全不如此。\n我的故乡好得多了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hometown I remember was nothing like this.\nMy hometown was far better."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私の記憶にある故郷は、まるでこうではなかった。\n私の故郷はもっとずっと良かった。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我所记得的故乡全不如此。\n我的故乡好得多了。"
