    "隐藏的书只在验证身份后显示，退出 App 后自动重新隐藏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hidden books appear only after you verify your identity, and are hidden again when you leave the app."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非表示の本は本人確認後にだけ表示され、アプリを離れると自動的に再び隠れます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
